{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_lfzozsrhmt4hbciisdyg4wnjpdzftqz3xjvtci7x4kumgy4atvya","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01R6Vm7uD2kUrJQAhdNZPsRt","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"oEVCBoWMrSozqyLTP60OiS","description":"Read all text on Start Here and Foundations pages (read-only)","code":"const out=[];\nfor (const id of ['0:1','1:2']) {\n  const p = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n  await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);\n  out.push('=== PAGE '+p.name);\n  const walk=(n,d)=>{ \n    let s='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.id+' \"'+n.name+'\"';\n    if('width' in n) s+=` ${Math.round(n.x)},${Math.round(n.y)} ${Math.round(n.width)}x${Math.round(n.height)}`;\n    if(n.type==='TEXT') s+=' :: '+n.characters.slice(0,2000);\n    out.push(s);\n    if('children' in n) n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1));\n  };\n  p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));\n}\nreturn out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1253,"cache_read_input_tokens":8113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cec50fe8-0981-4a9e-a5f5-60c5e79e1651","uuid":"e03ddc18-6f80-4f78-8989-412985eafdd8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:22:46.631Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01R6Vm7uD2kUrJQAhdNZPsRt","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01R6Vm7uD2kUrJQAhdNZPsRt","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== PAGE 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 11:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 0,0 1400x4056\n  FRAME 11:3 \"Header\" 0,0 1400x237\n    TEXT 11:4 \"DESIGNER STARTER / PARADISE INVEST · LEVEL L2 · v2\" 56,48 482x27 :: DESIGNER STARTER / PARADISE INVEST · LEVEL L2 · v2\n    TEXT 11:5 \"Complete mobile product design\" 56,87 622x63 :: Complete mobile product design\n    TEXT 11:6 \"Content, structure, brand primary and typefaces are fixed. Layout, hierarchy, all other colors, states, components and visual system are yours.\" 56,162 1207x27 :: Content, structure, brand primary and typefaces are fixed. Layout, hierarchy, all other colors, states, components and visual system are yours.\n  FRAME 11:7 \"Body\" 0,237 1400x3819\n    FRAME 11:8 \"THE ASSIGNMENT\" 56,52 1288x238\n      TEXT 11:9 \"THE ASSIGNMENT\" 0,0 180x30 :: THE ASSIGNMENT\n      TEXT 11:10 \"Design the complete Paradise Invest mobile investment app (brand: Paradise Group) for a first-time investor: sign up, understand their portfolio, follow plans and news, and manage their profile and bank accounts.\" 0,40 1288x48 :: Design the complete Paradise Invest mobile investment app (brand: Paradise Group) for a first-time investor: sign up, understand their portfolio, follow plans and news, and manage their profile and bank accounts.\n      TEXT 11:11 \"English interface / Nigerian Naira (₦) / one signed-in user: Jonas Macroni. Base viewport 414 × 932 for every frame; Home may scroll vertically.\" 0,98 1288x24 :: English interface / Nigerian Naira (₦) / one signed-in user: Jonas Macroni. Base viewport 414 × 932 for every frame; Home may scroll vertically.\n      TEXT 11:12 \"FIXED by this brief: frame list & names, the content each frame must contain (what, not how), navigation structure, all data and copy, brand primary color, typefaces (DM Sans + Inter), media, a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell.\" 0,132 1288x48 :: FIXED by this brief: frame list & names, the content each frame must contain (what, not how), navigation structure, all data and copy, brand primary color, typefaces (DM Sans + Inter), media, a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell.\n      TEXT 11:13 \"YOURS to decide: layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen; all other colors (neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic); type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; all states (selected, pressed, disabled, focused, error); headers, bottom navigation and every business component.\" 0,190 1288x48 :: YOURS to decide: layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen; all other colors (neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic); type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; all states (selected, pressed, disabled, focused, error); headers, bottom navigation and every business component.\n    FRAME 11:14 \"FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES\" 56,330 1288x98\n      TEXT 11:15 \"FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES\" 0,0 534x30 :: FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES\n      TEXT 11:16 \"01_Splash · 02_Welcome · 03_Create_Account_Empty · 03_Create_Account_Filled · 03_Create_Account_Error · 04_Home ·\" 0,40 1288x24 :: 01_Splash · 02_Welcome · 03_Create_Account_Empty · 03_Create_Account_Filled · 03_Create_Account_Error · 04_Home ·\n      TEXT 11:17 \"05_My_Asset_Overlay · 06_Notification · 07_Profile · 08_Contact_Info · 09_Bank_Account_Info. One frame per state.\" 0,74 1288x24 :: 05_My_Asset_Overlay · 06_Notification · 07_Profile · 08_Contact_Info · 09_Bank_Account_Info. One frame per state.\n    FRAME 11:18 \"Frame checklist\" 56,468 1288x2389\n      TEXT 11:19 \"FRAME-BY-FRAME CHECKLIST\" 0,0 303x30 :: FRAME-BY-FRAME CHECKLIST\n      TEXT 48:57 \"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks. Layout, groupi