count: “Welcome, Jonas.” · menu entry · notification entry\n• Actions: Invest now\n• Articles: “Investment Guide” · 3 articles, each with title, summary and thumbnail\n• Main navigation: current tab Home\n• Plans: “Best Plans” · See All · Gold 30% / Silver 60% / Platinum 90% return, each with its coin image\n• Portfolio: “Your total asset portfolio” · ₦203,935 · +2%\n        TEXT 11:40 \"Links: portfolio → 05_My_Asset_Overlay; notification entry → 06_Notification; Account tab → 07_Profile.\" 20,236 1248x23 :: Links: portfolio → 05_My_Asset_Overlay; notification entry → 06_Notification; Account tab → 07_Profile.\n      FRAME 11:41 \"05_My_Asset_Overlay\" 0,1143 1288x273\n        TEXT 11:42 \"05_My_Asset_Overlay\" 20,14 196x26 :: 05_My_Asset_Overlay\n        TEXT 11:43 \"Goal: inspect holdings and recent activity without leaving Home.\" 20,44 1248x23 :: Goal: inspect holdings and recent activity without leaving Home.\n        TEXT 11:44 \"Must include: • Actions: close · See All Plans • Copy: “My Asset” • Current plan: “Current Plans” · Gold · 30% return • History: “History” · 4 transactions, each with type (Buy / Sell), stock, amount and date • Portfolio: “Your total asset portfolio” · ₦203,935 · +2% • Presentation: opens over Home; Home stays behind it\" 20,71 1248x161 :: Must include:\n• Actions: close · See All Plans\n• Copy: “My Asset”\n• Current plan: “Current Plans” · Gold · 30% return\n• History: “History” · 4 transactions, each with type (Buy / Sell), stock, amount and date\n• Portfolio: “Your total asset portfolio” · ₦203,935 · +2%\n• Presentation: opens over Home; Home stays behind it\n        TEXT 11:45 \"Links: close → 04_Home.\" 20,236 1248x23 :: Links: close → 04_Home.\n      FRAME 11:46 \"06_Notification\" 0,1438 1288x204\n        TEXT 11:47 \"06_Notification\" 20,14 133x26 :: 06_Notification\n        TEXT 11:48 \"Goal: scan recent updates quickly.\" 20,44 1248x23 :: Goal: scan recent updates quickly.\n        TEXT 11:49 \"Must include: • Actions: back