{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_6jfrdp4oewmeb3xqtnw454pqpteqvjuyjkjmabn3khegh2uzzhjq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all 11 frames in 03 · Workspace, plus a reusable component library and the prototype flows. I checked a screenshot of every frame, and the layout problems I found are fixed. The four reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were only read, not changed. I confirmed the account was fulinbo@tetras.ai before making any changes.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/oEVCBoWMrSozqyLTP60OiS/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `2003:2`\n\n### Screens (414 × 932 each)\n| Frame | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Splash | `2017:133` |\n| 02_Welcome | `2017:151` |\n| 03_Create_Account_Empty | `2017:180` |\n| 03_Create_Account_Filled | `2017:231` |\n| 03_Create_Account_Error | `2017:282` |\n| 04_Home | `2019:267` |\n| 05_My_Asset_Overlay | `2020:375` |\n| 06_Notification | `2022:567` |\n| 07_Profile | `2022:610` |\n| 08_Contact_Info | `2022:726` |\n| 09_Bank_Account_Info | `2022:795` |\n\n### Design system\n- **Colors:** a \"Paradise Color\" variable collection with 19 colors built around the #31A062 primary, covering text, surfaces, borders, gain/loss, error, disabled and the overlay scrim.\n- **Type:** 11 text styles in DM Sans (headings and amounts) and Inter (body and labels).\n- **Component board** (\"Components · Paradise Invest\", `2009:2`):\n  - Built on the supplied components: Action Button (Primary, Pressed, Disabled, Secondary, On Primary) uses the supplied Button. Form Field (Empty, Focused, Filled and Error, each with a password version that has a Show toggle) uses the supplied Text Field.\n  - Navigation and headers: Tab Item and Tab Bar (Current = Home or Account), Icon Button (swappable icon, optional notification dot), Header with back button, Section Header.\n  - Content: Portfolio Card, Change Badge, Plan Card, Current Plan Row, Article Card (photo or fallback), Transaction Row (Buy or Sell), Notification Row (photo or avatar, read or unread), Menu Row, Detail Row (added or missing), Bank Account Card, Avatar, Sheet Handle.\n- Every frame uses the supplied status bar and home indicator. Images and icons are reused from 04 · Media, and the same Gold coin appears on Home and My Asset. \"Welcome to New NASDAQ\" has no supplied photo, so its fallback is a light-green tile with the Transaction icon.\n\n### Prototype (19 interactions; the flow starts at 01_Splash)\n- 01 moves to 02 automatically after 1.5 s.\n- 02: Create account → 03_Empty.\n- 03 (all three states): back → 02. On Filled, Create account → 04. Create account is disabled on Empty and Error.\n- Two extra demo links: tapping the form on Empty → Filled, and tapping the email field on Error → Filled.\n- 04: the portfolio card opens 05 as an overlay; the notification bell → 06; the Account tab → 07.\n- 05: close (or tapping the dimmed area) → 04. 06: back → 04.\n- 07: Home tab → 04, Contact Info → 08, Bank Account Info → 09.\n- 08 and 09: back → 07.\n\n### Limitations\n- **The 05 overlay:** it opens with Figma's overlay action, and the frame contains a dimmed copy of Home behind the sheet. That copy is static, so it won't pick up later changes to 04_Home.\n- **Home scrolling:** Home scrolls inside its 932 px frame, with the tab bar and status bar fixed. A static screenshot therefore cuts the Investment Guide list off at the first article. The other two articles are there and show up when you scroll in the prototype.\n- **Added copy:** I added a few short helper texts that aren't in the brief: \"Loading your portfolio…\", \"Today's change\", \"Active plan\", \"Buy · money out\" and \"Sell · money in\", the field placeholders and hints, and \"No address added\" / \"No phone number added\". All the copy the brief requires is used exactly as written.\n- **Entry-only actions:** menu, Invest now, See All, See All Plans, Login, Settings and the other entry-only actions are drawn but not linked, as the brief allows."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":120307,"cache_read_input_tokens":7727,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":120307,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cec50fe8-0981-4a9e-a5f5-60c5e79e1651","uuid":"76938a9e-66e0-492a-b242-164c2925e3b8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:45:27.750Z"}
